<h1><span>Info</span></h1>
<p><strong>Basalt</strong> is an aesthetic theme for the SCP Wiki by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/liryn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6254643); return false;"><img class="small" src="https://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6254643&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1784685132" alt="Liryn" style="background-image:url(https://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6254643)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/liryn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6254643); return false;">Liryn</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6536693); return false;"><img class="small" src="https://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1784685132" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(https://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6536693); return false;">Placeholder McD</a></span> functioning as an extension of <strong>Bedrock</strong>, a base theme created specifically for this project. Visit <a href="https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/theme:bedrock">Bedrock's wiki page</a> or <a href="https://basalt-team.github.io/Basalt">its home on GitHub</a> for more info, including all of the CSS variables it offers.</p>
<div style="margin-top: 6.5rem;"></div>
<h1><span>Theme settings</span></h1>
<p>Add <strong>theme settings</strong> to your <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include]]</span> module to modify aspects of Basalt.<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p>
<p><strong><tt><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;</span><span style="opacity: 70%;"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">:scp-wiki:</span></span><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">theme:basalt&#32;</span><span style="color: green">themesetting</span><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]]</span></tt></strong></p>
<p><strong><tt><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;</span><span style="opacity: 70%;"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">:scp-wiki:</span></span><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">theme:basalt&#32;</span><span style="color: green">themesetting</span>|<span style="color: purple">another-themesetting</span><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]]</span></tt></strong></p>
