<li><strong><tt>hidetitle=a</tt></strong><span class="noclick"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></span>Removes page title</li>
<li><strong><tt>centertitle=a</tt></strong><span class="noclick"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></span>Centers page title</li>
<li><strong><tt>acs-itemnum=a</tt></strong><span class="noclick"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></span>Restores <a href="https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/anomaly-classification-system-guide">ACS</a> &quot;ITEM#:&quot; text</li>
<li><strong><tt>disable-acs-anim=a</tt></strong><span class="noclick"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></span>Disables <a href="https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/component:acs-animation">ACS Animation</a> component</li>
